WEBVTT

00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:48.410
Crap, I can't see very well.

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:49.580
Huh?

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:54.370
What's this?

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:32.500
"22/7 (nanabun no nijyuuni)"

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:36.580
Everyone, welcome to 22/7.

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:38.290
I-It spoke?!

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.950
Did the Wall just speak?!

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:52.500
All of your feelings
about being idols have touched me.

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:55.950
Are you the Wall?

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:58.410
Yes, I am.

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:01.250
What do you mean by "welcome"?

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:06.370
It is a formal greeting.
There is no deeper meaning to it.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:09.700
If you could talk,
why didn't you up until now?

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:14.370
My intent is not to interact.
It is observation.

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:16.000
Observation?

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:19.290
I wanted to see how the eight of you,
chosen to be idols, would think.

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:22.040
How you would conduct yourselves.

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:28.750
My recordings of those days
were the main part of my goal.

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:31.330
This room...

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:34.910
Because of everything
that happened here in this room,

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:41.660
we do know minute details
about your speech and conduct.

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:47.120
Details...

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:51.290
Is that so?

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:53.830
Did you have fun, pervert?

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:59.160
You did as ordered to the letter,
and gave me wonderful results.

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:03.620
This was an experiment, of sorts.

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:09.620
As objects of worship,
how would idols move people?

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:10.790
An experiment?!

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:13.950
Moving hearts?

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:19.330
Actually, you were all part
of a much greater movement within society.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:25.330
Because of your disbandment, we were able
to move on to the next phase of our plan.

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.540
Plan? What plan?

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:31.410
It is difficult to explain.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:36.000
Let's just call it "Project 22/7", shall we?

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.830
Project 22/7?

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:44.830
Why were we picked
as the subjects of your experiment?

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:47.410
No particular reason.

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:51.580
You were all picked randomly.

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:58.540
You could say it was just a coincidence.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:00.330
C-Coincidence?

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:05.500
Thank you, everyone,
for your cooperation up until this point.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:08.370
And, good work.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:10.160
G-Good work?

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:12.160
But we didn't...

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:16.830
You've said whatever ya want
this whole time...

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:19.540
Just what do ya think people's hearts are?!

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:21.160
Miyako!

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:25.290
Does this mean you've been
using us and our fans?!

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:27.580
Do ya think we'd be satisfied with that?!

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:29.160
After all, we're...

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:30.250
"HAVE YOUR DEBUT CONCERT
ON FEBRUARY 27th"

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:35.910
"PARTICIPATE IN THE ITF"

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:43.000
We're...

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.830
Miyako...

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:54.870
Please.

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:56.250
Nicole?

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:59.580
Please allow us to continue.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.120
Elizabeth, you're working
with another agency--

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:03.410
Shut up.

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:08.750
Seriously, all of you are so useless.

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:10.290
Nicole...

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:13.750
I can't even tell if you guys
still want to do this.

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:17.500
Constantly getting in my way,
making such strong claims...

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:22.750
So I have no choice but to do this.

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:28.620
Because you're the ones who really understand
how I want to be an idol.

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:30.950
Nicorun...

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:32.450
Nicole...

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:37.500
So, please... Allow us to continue.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.660
You cannot continue.

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:40.950
Wh-Why?!

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:45.120
I believe I already told you.
Our plan has already moved to its next phase.

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:48.450
You have served your purpose.

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:51.000
Please!

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.120
You cannot continue.

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:54.620
Please!

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:56.080
Nicole!

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.830
You cannot continue.

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:02.580
Please... Allow us...

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:07.540
You cann--

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:22.700
Miu...

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:39.950
You know nothing!

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:42.620
You've seen nothing!

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:43.500
Miu...

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:46.330
Sakura...

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:50.950
Even though I was shy around strangers,
she reached out her hand to me.

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:56.790
She's so kind, and gave me the courage
to continue being an idol.

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:58.580
Miu!

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.700
And Reika...

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:07.250
She's so strong.
As our leader, she always supported 22/7.

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:09.500
Miu!

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:16.750
Miyako has always been the life of the party,
and united us as a team.

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:25.120
Jun's always been so positive,
and has brightened up our team.

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:27.120
Our cute little sister!

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:34.000
Akane was always so happy
whenever we had a good concert.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:36.000
She's so warm-hearted.

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:40.870
And Saito...

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:47.870
She always made us want to sing and dance.
She's the heart of our group.

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:54.080
Ayaka was always so cool,
and maybe seems a bit blunt,

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:57.080
but she has loved 22/7 the most.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:04.750
I've always thought
that idols were so contrived,

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:07.000
but I was wrong.

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:12.330
Even though we were all so confused,
they always desperately tried to be positive.

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:20.450
We all love 22/7.

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:26.080
So what that you're the Wall?!
So what about your Orders?!

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:31.660
You have no right to stop us as idols.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.540
Saito?

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:55.580
You don't need me to help, do you?

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:01.160
Seriously! So what if you're the great Wall?!

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:04.250
We won't borrow your power anymore!

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:08.580
That's right!
Quit messing around and shut up!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.700
S-T-O-P!

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:12.700
We don't need any Orders!

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:14.160
We're...

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:17.160
We're 22/7!

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:19.250
We don't need your help!

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:22.620
The eight of us will continue all on our own!

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:33.000
Wind?

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:36.910
Move, Christel!

00:10:58.540 --> 00:10:59.750
This is...

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:26.200
Wh-What is this?

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:33.370
Was this really... Here all along?

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:36.500
It was here, beyond the Wall...

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:38.000
It's a bit scary.

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:40.700
H-How is this random?

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:43.700
All of these pictures here...

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:48.330
Have they been following us
since we were children?

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:58.370
Wh-What do we do? What do we do?

00:11:58.370 --> 00:12:00.620
Won't it get mad at us for this?

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:07.450
But, don't you want to know?

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:12.830
The real reason why
we were gathered together?

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:03.660
Hey, will it really get mad at us for this?

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.290
You're clinging too closely, Jun.

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:08.950
But it's like a haunted house!

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:13.330
We seem to be climbing up a fair bit.

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:14.950
It's been all stairs.

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:17.910
We were in an underground facility, though.

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:20.450
I wonder where it's leading us to?

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:49.660
Is everyone ready?

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:52.700
Don't complain if something's waiting for us.

00:13:57.040 --> 00:13:59.500
Wh-Wheat flour!

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:04.450
Pork!

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:05.910
Tenkasu!

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:07.290
Dried Shrimp!

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:08.660
Chinese yam!

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:10.250
Pickled ginger!

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:11.790
Eggs!

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:12.830
Cabbage!

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:15.450
Flip it over!

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:18.870
22/7!

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:21.870
This is still so weird!

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:24.160
How is it weird?
Don't you mean it's the best?

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:26.000
I love it.

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:28.450
It's alright.

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:33.200
From now on,
we choose our own future.

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:36.870
There is no more Wall in this world.

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:38.200
Yeah!

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:39.700
Let's go!

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:09.950
They're here!

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:11.410
They really came!

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:15.410
Wh-What?

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:33.290
This song...

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:35.370
Nicorun!

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:37.000
Sakura!

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:38.410
Miyako!

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:40.410
Akane!

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:42.160
This is...

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:43.950
I-I-It's...

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:45.910
It's the zoo's...

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:57.500
Miu! We believed in you!

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:01.410
That 22/7 wouldn't leave!

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:03.250
We believed in you!

00:16:04.410 --> 00:16:05.620
That's right!

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:08.790
--I did, too!
--22/7 rocks!

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:10.830
Happy first anniversary!

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:12.450
Congratulations!

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:16.040
What the heck is this?
We told y'all we were disbanding!

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:20.370
We still believed you'd come back to us, Jun!

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:27.250
So it wasn't just us who went to the office
for our formation day, huh?

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:29.160
Miu!

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:38.450
Ayaka!

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:41.540
Reika!

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:46.200
There were this many people
who cared about our anniversary concert...

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:51.330
Miu?

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:52.370
Let's sing.

00:16:55.500 --> 00:17:00.580
It doesn't matter where,
or who we do this for!

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:09.120
Let's sing, here and now!

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:12.250
Let's dance, here and now!

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:14.830
Miu!

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:55.950
As you've probably heard,
the rumors as to why 22/7 was created were true.

00:17:55.950 --> 00:18:01.160
We didn't understand it, and perhaps that makes
the motive behind our group dishonest.

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:06.000
Not all of us set out to be idols
at the beginning.

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:13.040
But I will tell you clearly, now.

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:16.250
We love being idols.

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:19.540
We're not sure what the future holds for us.

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:24.540
We're not sure what will happen
with our activities tomorrow.

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:29.830
But as long as we have our precious friends
and our fans cheering us on,

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:34.000
22/7 will continue to be idols.

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:39.540
Please listen.
This is, "It's Difficult."

00:18:57.450 --> 00:19:03.870
♪ The never-ending traffic ♪

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:10.200
♪ Stops me from crossing the street ♪

00:19:12.370 --> 00:19:18.950
♪ All the hateful words and cold stares ♪

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:25.580
♪ Are making my heart wither away ♪

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:30.450
♪ Even if I want to chase my dream ♪

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:34.450
♪ I know all too well
that I only get hurt doing so ♪

00:19:34.450 --> 00:19:37.000
I don't know where I am

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:40.040
I can't see a thing in this world
and I have no clue what to do

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:41.950
What direction should I go?

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:43.700
I don't want to go anywhere anymore

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:51.330
♪ Say, why do we have to go on living? ♪

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:58.700
♪ What's the meaning of life? ♪

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:06.250
♪ I have no confidence,
how should I go on living? (loneliness) ♪

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:10.410
♪ Life is just too long ♪

00:20:10.410 --> 00:20:12.080
Everything is so hard

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:14.950
Seems like the girls are having fun.

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:20.790
The uniforms, the location of the mics...

00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:25.580
How to guide the fans,
the timing of the lights...

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:29.040
The Wall suddenly spat out
a mountain of Orders.

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.370
--♪ The classroom curtains sigh ♪

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:37.250
--Just one of them said,
"They must come, but do not force them."
--♪ The classroom curtains sigh ♪

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:41.450
--Perhaps this is what the Wall
wanted to show them.
--♪ Swelling and shrinking many times ♪

00:20:41.450 --> 00:20:46.080
Along with the feeling of being true idols
and the fans that believed in them.

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:47.450
--♪ In a boring class with just my classmates ♪

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:52.160
--As opposed to when they got played,
they should be able to see
a completely different scene.
--♪ In a boring class with just my classmates ♪

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:57.870
--When it told them to disband,
not one of them said there was "no helping it."
--♪ Nothing, it seems, can hold my interest ♪

00:20:57.870 --> 00:20:59.370
--There is absolutely no mistaking
that they're the "eight chosen ones."
--♪ Nothing, it seems, can hold my interest ♪

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:04.250
--There is absolutely no mistaking
that they're the "eight chosen ones."
--♪ In order to escape my daily life ♪

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:06.660
--♪ There was only one method to do so. ♪

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:08.200
--Anyways, I should...
--♪ There was only one method to do so. ♪

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:10.200
--Gouda, your nose is as red as a reindeer's.
--♪ Because I don't use
kind words ♪

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:13.080
--Gouda, your nose is as red as a reindeer's.
--♪ Because everything I dream
will not come true ♪

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.540
--I didn't want to miss out at work.
I'm just relieved.
--♪ I want you to be honest with me ♪

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:16.580
--I didn't want to miss out at work.
I'm just relieved.
--♪ Tell me everything is an illusion ♪

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:24.200
♪ Say, why do we have to go on living? ♪

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:31.620
♪ What's the meaning of life? ♪

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:39.120
♪ I have no confidence,
how should I go on living? (loneliness) ♪

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:43.290
♪ Life is just too long ♪

00:21:43.290 --> 00:21:44.540
Everything is so hard

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:08.580
22/7! 22/7!

00:22:24.580 --> 00:22:26.040
Thank you!

00:22:28.540 --> 00:22:31.790
Huh, I had no idea.

00:22:31.790 --> 00:22:35.950
I used to think,
"she can't smile like an idol."

00:22:48.200 --> 00:22:49.330
Yeah!

00:23:37.580 --> 00:23:41.040
"HAVE THREE MORE MEMBERS JOIN"

00:23:44.410 --> 00:23:48.790
I wonder why is 22/7 called "22/7"?

00:23:48.790 --> 00:23:51.290
Yum, this boba latte's delicious!

00:23:51.290 --> 00:23:54.040
It sure is a weird name.

00:23:54.040 --> 00:23:57.370
Well, there is only progress!

00:23:57.370 --> 00:23:59.040
You're so positive.

00:23:59.040 --> 00:24:00.330
Another!

00:24:07.160 --> 00:24:12.080
Thanks for watching 22/7!
